  ],
  "why": "Eviction happens at ledger close with no transaction: the keys of the evicted entries and their TTL entries appear only in LedgerCloseMeta's evicted_keys, temporary entries are deleted and persistent ones move to the hot archive. Readers that track contract state from transaction meta alone keep entries that no longer exist.",
